    <string name="privacy_policy">PRIVACY POLICY</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Event names, dates, notes, pinned status, drafts and settings are stored on this device. The app works without an internet connection. It does not include analytics, advertising, purchases or an account system. Included pictures are bundled with the app. Automatic cloud backup is disabled. Deleting an event removes it from the app\'s local collection. Uninstalling the app removes its local data.</string>
